#ASSERT `sch 9 para 4(1) the body is a supervisory authority` `the Financial Conduct Authority` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 4(1) the body is a supervisory authority` `the Gambling Commission` EQUALS JUST TRUE
