-- ss 330(12)(b), 331(8) and 333E(1)(b) hand "what is a supervisory authority" to this list: a body in none of the heads is not one
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 4(1) the body is a supervisory authority` `another body` EQUALS JUST FALSE
